<title>FINLAND: Tamro 1996 profit rises 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Tamro 1996 profit rises 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   224 vs 155</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.73 vs 1.33</p>
<p> Net sales					 13,220 vs 10,735</p>
<p> Operating profit				   242 vs 181</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecasts for Finnish pharmaceuticals wholesaler Oy Tamro Ab had been for a 216 million markka profit after financial items.  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 329 vs 262</p>
<p> Depreciation					  87 vs 81</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 11 vs 14 charge</p>
<p> Profit before taxes				223 vs 157</p>
<p> Net profit					   150 vs 120</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    39.7 vs 42.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish pharmaceuticals wholesaler is Oy Tamro Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
</text>
